# The functions of Mission_FicusBanker in level press (the script levels/press/scripts/mission_ficusbanker.py of data01.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script are C (src/game/Script/levels/Press.c): InitStatus, Init, CreatePoliceFicusInit, FicusMissionSpeech, CreateBankDirectorScrapusInit, ScrapusMissionSpeech, InitKillScrapus, SpawnCheck, TakeCheck, SetNextMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/press/mission_ficusbanker.def replaces this file.
section InitTalkFicus2
call Scrap.SetSaveVar "Mission_Police_FicusBanker" "TalkFicus2"
